<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Praise God the Father who’s the source;</l><l>Praise God the Son who is the course;</l><l>Praise God the Spirit who’s the flow;</l><l>Praise God, our portion here below!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
